msgid "上传失败"
msgstr "Upload failed"

msgid "上传失败，请检查网络或服务器状态。"
msgstr "Upload failed. Check network or server status."

msgid "把构建与发布收敛成一套可复用的流程"
msgstr "Standardize Your Build & Release Flow"

msgid "每个项目先定义工作区路径、环境和构建模板。项目路径相对于统一工作区根，可对应真实目录，也可对应管理员维护的软链接。"
msgstr "Define the workspace path, environments, and build template for each project first. The project path is relative to the shared workspace root and can point to a real directory or an admin-managed symlink."

msgid "项目总数"
msgstr "Total Projects"

msgid "环境总数"
msgstr "Total Environments"

msgid "已登记 Release"
msgstr "Registered Releases"

msgid "入口 1"
msgstr "Entry 1"

msgid "新项目接入"
msgstr "New Project"

msgid "适合首次接入。创建项目后，继续在项目工作台里完成模板和环境配置。"
msgstr "For first-time onboarding. Complete setup in the project workspace."

msgid "入口 2"
msgstr "Entry 2"

msgid "继续构建与发布"
msgstr "Continue Building"

msgid "已有项目直接进入工作台，主操作永远是\"一键生成\"或\"一键生成并发布\"。"
msgstr "Existing projects go straight to the workspace. The main actions remain one-click build or one-click build and deploy."

msgid "入口 3"
msgstr "Entry 3"

msgid "异常排查"
msgstr "Troubleshoot"

msgid "部署任务页集中查看超时、失败、回滚和状态轮询，不需要再翻多个页面。"
msgstr "View all deployment issues in one place."

msgid "新增项目"
msgstr "New Project"

msgid "创建项目时先填工作区路径。它相对于统一工作区根，可以是真目录，也可以是管理员提前放好的软链接目录。"
msgstr "Set the workspace path when creating a project. It is relative to the shared workspace root and can be a real directory or a symlink prepared by an administrator."

msgid "项目名称"
msgstr "Project Name"

msgid "项目标识"
msgstr "Slug"

msgid "项目工作区路径"
msgstr "Workspace Path"

msgid "浏览选择"
msgstr "Browse"

msgid "工作区模型"
msgstr "Workspace Model"

msgid "统一工作区根"
msgstr "Unified Workspace Root"

msgid "推荐把所有待发布项目聚合到同一个工作区根下。这里填写的是相对路径；如果你偏向软链接方案，可由管理员先在工作区根下创建软链接，再在这里选择该目录。"
msgstr "It is recommended to gather all deployable projects under one workspace root. Enter a relative path here. If you prefer a symlink-based setup, let an administrator create the symlink under the workspace root first, then select that directory here."

msgid "发布协议"
msgstr "Deploy Protocol"

msgid "这是当前唯一支持的执行适配器，表示平台会把 `manifest_url` 通过 webhook 发给兼容的 `deploy-agent`。新用户不需要修改，先按默认值使用即可。"
msgstr "This is the only supported execution adapter for now. It sends the `manifest_url` to a compatible `deploy-agent` via webhook. New users can keep the default value."

msgid "项目说明"
msgstr "Description"

msgid "描述此项目如何接入、部署到哪里、谁负责。"
msgstr "Describe how this project is onboarded, where it deploys, and who owns it."

msgid "创建并进入接入流程"
msgstr "Create & Start Onboarding"

msgid "已接入项目"
msgstr "Onboarded Projects"

msgid "进入项目后可配置构建模板、环境、生成策略和一键发布入口。"
msgstr "After entering a project, you can configure build templates, environments, generation strategy, and one-click deploy actions."

msgid "工作区路径："
msgstr "Workspace: "

msgid "未设置，默认使用全局工作区根"
msgstr "Not set, defaults to workspace root"

msgid "镜像仓库前缀："
msgstr "Registry Prefix: "

msgid "未设置，默认不拼接 registry 前缀"
msgstr "Not set, no registry prefix"

msgid "个 Release"
msgstr "releases"

msgid "个构建任务"
msgstr "builds"

msgid "进入项目工作台"
msgstr "Open Workspace"

msgid "编辑或删除项目"
msgstr "Edit / Delete Project"

msgid "保存项目信息"
msgstr "Save Project"

msgid "确认删除该项目？这会连同其环境、Release、构建任务和部署记录一起删除。"
msgstr "Delete this project? This also deletes its environments, releases, build jobs, and deployment records."

msgid "当前目录下没有子目录。"
msgstr "No subdirectories in the current directory."

msgid "进入"
msgstr "Open"

msgid "选择"
msgstr "Select"

msgid "删除项目"
msgstr "Delete Project"

msgid "还没有项目，先创建一个项目开始接入。"
msgstr "No projects yet. Create one to get started."

